\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\f1\fs22 In VBScript, this statement repeats a block of code while a condition is true.
\par 
\par }{\f2\fs22 <%\tab Do While condition
\par \tab \tab [statements]
\par \tab Exit Do
